# The local Plow stack this checkout's `just build` and `just dev-login` use
# (`just gatekeeper` then asks it on that login). Copy to .env.local (gitignored)
# and uncomment what you need. `just` reads it; the latch binary never does.
# Only these variables belong here: never a Plow token, and no PLOW_* names.
#
# With nothing set: the plow checkout "main"'s ports,
# API http://127.0.0.1:18934 and Linq twin http://127.0.0.1:18935.

# A plow checkout whose dev stack is up (`just api up`, `just dtu linq up`):
# its .plow-dev-env gives the API (PLOW_API_URL) and the twin
# (PLOW_DTU_LINQ_PORT), which plow derives from that checkout's PLOW_VARIANT.
# LATCH_DEV_PLOW_CHECKOUT=~/code/plow

# Or name either one outright; these win over the checkout's.
# LATCH_DEV_PLOW_API=http://127.0.0.1:18934
# LATCH_DEV_PLOW_TWIN=http://127.0.0.1:18935
